        "slc_8ae2b41d345716c2e5406fc50ace964637906ea172d44336fd07129dfe96bf60"
      ],
      "text": "Model output is treated as a proposal, never authority: every native action is bound to a durable authorization, re-checked before execution, and followed by recorded validation; repository content, model output, and downloaded skills are untrusted."
    },
